":"@[member=\"TheBHolders\"] I&#039;m staying right off 5th street. I didn&#039;t know there was a mac store there","Attachments":[],"Id":1880854,"PostDate":1419059619,"PostContent":"@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278146\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TheBHolders<\/span><\/a> I'm staying right off 5th street. I didn't know there was a mac store there ","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401107633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1413751092","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78497,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 20 December 2014 - 07:23 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1419060209,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a6a4e5db2bde514e6702d70a77cec8c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am not exactly sure where these companies are located, but on the boards these artists are talked about a lot.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(sorry if I miss any) &amp;nbsp; You could also check the review section as there is a whole thread for this :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- MVP &amp;nbsp; (pretty sure they are in Playa)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Styling Trio&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Beso Brides&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Edit: here is the link &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/c\/21730-hair-makeup-favors-reviews\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/c\/21730-hair-makeup-favors-reviews\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880855,"PostDate":1419060152,"PostContent":"<p>I am not exactly sure where these companies are located, but on the boards these artists are talked about a lot.<\/p>\n<p>(sorry if I miss any) \u00a0 You could also check the review section as there is a whole thread for this <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- MVP \u00a0 (pretty sure they are in Playa)<\/p>\n<p>- Styling Trio<\/p>\n<p>- Beso Brides<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Edit: here is the link \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/c\/21730-hair-makeup-favors-reviews\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...favors-reviews\/<\/a><\/p>\n","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Currently have 44 guests, plus bride and groom \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1412308242","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"179.53.139.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78497,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6515307b8a6b89cafd644b4f5e1ef521","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We can also highly recommend Styling Trio.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve seen Adrian and team ply their magic to have the bride at the top of her game, looking the Best she could Beeeee! Priceless!!!...especially when you consider you&#039;ll be captured on your Wedding Day Love Story photos that you&#039;ll cherish for a lifetime :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a visual of what we&#039;re talking about.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/p417x417\/385792_10151439479994487_1820231703_n.jpg?oh=0d8f8b5b6741b075eeec8ff272c98540&amp;amp;oe=5501A228&amp;amp;__gda__=1430422937_f31e3d366a62dba894ac5b926db77bf1\" alt=\"385792_10151439479994487_1820231703_n.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/884535_10151439486639487_1076782551_o.jpg\" alt=\"884535_10151439486639487_1076782551_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can see how beautiful this bride looked for her entire Big Day here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/MomentsThatMatterPhotography\/photos\/a.10151439479429487.1073741825.18683524486\/10151439486639487\/?type=3&amp;amp;theater&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, LisaAnthonyPoppy, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880864,"PostDate":1419089665,"PostContent":"<p>We can also highly recommend Styling Trio.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've seen Adrian and team ply their magic to have the bride at the top of her game, looking the Best she could Beeeee! Priceless!!!...especially when you consider you'll be captured on your Wedding Day Love Story photos that you'll cherish for a lifetime <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a visual of what we're talking about.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/p417x417\/385792_10151439479994487_1820231703_n.jpg?oh=0d8f8b5b6741b075eeec8ff272c98540&oe=5501A228&__gda__=1430422937_f31e3d366a62dba894ac5b926db77bf1\" alt=\"385792_10151439479994487_1820231703_n.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/884535_10151439486639487_1076782551_o.jpg\" alt=\"884535_10151439486639487_1076782551_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can see how beautiful this bride looked for her entire Big Day here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/MomentsThatMatterPhotography\/photos\/a.10151439479429487.1073741825.18683524486\/10151439486639487\/?type=3&theater' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, LisaAnthonyPoppy, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78497,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a20f93fabc3131a23807fb31f74235b8","RawContent":"Anyone know anything about Sarah Garnier or Zoe Elizabeth?","Attachments":[],"Id":1880866,"PostDate":1419130628,"PostContent":"Anyone know anything about Sarah Garnier or Zoe Elizabeth? ","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401107633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1413751092","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"T